### home
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/

?? status equals 200
?? header content-type includes text/html
?? body includes pos-app

### runtime config
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/config.json

?? status equals 200
?? header content-type includes application/json
?? body includes ws://127.0.0.1:50050/api

### bundled capnweb client
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/app.js

?? status equals 200
?? header content-type includes text/javascript
?? body includes capnweb
